  exerciseTitle: Scenario (To-Do)
  videoWalkthroughUrl: https://unitycodemonkey.teachable.com/courses/problem-solving/lectures/63458755
  exerciseText: 'Enemy AI with a State Machine. The Enemy has various states, it
    looks for a Target (the Player) then when it finds it chases the target and finally
    attacks when in range.


    In this Scenario the Enemy walks automatically left,
    then it should approach the Player, find the target and shoot it.


    <b>NOTE:
    Completing this Exercise will DELETE all the files, so if you want to keep your
    own personal implementation of this System then make a BACKUP before clicking
    on Complete Exercise!</b>'
